Hi <%= @order.recipient_name %>,

<% if @stop.delivered? -%>
Your order from <%= @merchant.business_name %> was delivered at <%= @when %>.
<% if @order.leave_at_door -%>It was left at the door as requested.<% end -%>
<% if @stop.note.present? -%>Courier note: <%= @stop.note %><% end -%>
<% else -%>
Our courier could not deliver your order from <%= @merchant.business_name %> at <%= @when %> (<%= @stop.failure_reason.to_s.humanize.downcase %>).
It is going back to <%= @merchant.business_name %>, who will be in touch about another delivery.
<% end -%>

Crosstown, on behalf of <%= @merchant.business_name %>
